, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/1u2hg1", "id": "306922216927954", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974479_306922220261287_3494691593129033728_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=93ZR5W4PBIMQ7kNvwGRx9qt&_nc_oc=AdlAuxRbj4JPf6UMBUiRRwjXXqwk4CQh3AOV_rqX5G83zvblcNxsPB96i0WcIXKPx_U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwZc74Zu356imKPZtGYkZVP3zlengLVLBQbLjPBa51NQA&oe=69BE775F"}, "display_name": "Flying Aces: Navy Pilot Simulator", "keywords": ["Flight", "Simulator", "Simulation", "Aircraft", "Plane"], "long_description": "Flying Aces is a story based virtual reality experience unlike any other. You will experience what it\u2019s like to train to become a navy pilot. As gamers, we search for experiences that aren\u2019t possible in our daily lives. With Navy Pilot Simulator, we\u2019re able to bring the armchair pilot into the cockpit of a fighter jet. \n\nThe Oculus Go allows us to create an experience that previous generations of hardware aren\u2019t capable of. Conquering the game will require a skillset of hand eye coordination, decision making, and a tough stomach. You start out as a low ranked Ensign (below a junior lieutenant) tasked with learning the functionality of the F-18 Super Hornet. As you progress through the ranks, the missions become more challenging.\n\nFeatures:\n- Campaign with choice based missions\n- Combat Theater Mode\n- Landing Competition Mode\n- Free Flight Mode\n- Optimized Specifically for the Oculus Go\n- And more!", "short_description": "Flying Aces is a story based virtual reality experience unlike any other. You will experience what it\u2019s like to train to become a navy pilot. As gamers, we search for experiences that aren\u2019t possible in our daily lives. With Navy Pilot Simulator, we\u2019re able to bring the armchair pilot into the cockpit of a fighter jet."}]}, "developer_name": "TAS Systems Corp", "developer_privacy_policy_url": null, "developer_te